e2 ( { In the event of } 13... exf2 { White must avoid } 14. a8=Q $2 { due to } Qd1 $1 { when the mating threat saves Black, e.g. } 15. Bf1 Qxf1 16. Qg2 Qe1 17. Qa6 Ne4 $1 { with some kind of fortress. } ) 
 ( { Instead one simple way to the win after } 13... exf2 { is } 14. Qb1 $1 { and only then } -- 15. a8=Q $11 { , as observed by FSU70. } ) 
14. a8=Q e1=Q 15. Qbc8 ( { In view of } 15. Qbc8 Kh6 16. Qh8 Nh7 17. Qag8 { Black resigned. } ) 

